# Impeccable: config.json holds shared design-detector decisions and is tracked, so
# design waivers travel with the repo and get reviewed. Everything else in here is
# per-developer or per-session state. The un-ignore is explicit because a global
# excludes file (~/.config/git/ignore) may drop the whole directory.
!.impeccable/
.impeccable/*
!.impeccable/config.json
.pi-subagents/


